OL,3,AI'm not tempted to call an early
OL,4,Aelection, Burnham says
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham has insisted he is not
OL,7,Ftempted to call an early general
OL,8,Felection, arguing it would throw "the
OL,9,Fcountry into a backward-looking
OL,10,Fprocess".
OL,12,FDuring a round of BBC interviews ahead
OL,13,Fof Labour's annual conference, the
OL,14,Fprime minister said his focus was on
OL,15,Fhelping people with the cost of living
OL,16,Fand supporting businesses.
OL,18,FRecent polling has suggested Labour's
OL,19,Fposition has improved since Burnham
OL,20,Freplaced Sir Keir Starmer in Downing
OL,21,FStreet in July, although Reform UK and
OL,22,Fthe Conservatives are not far behind.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
