OL,3,ASouth African white genocide does not
OL,4,Aexist, new ambassador to US tells BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe notion of a mass attack on the
OL,7,Fwhite Afrikaner minority in South
OL,8,FAfrica does not exist, he told the BBC,
OL,9,Fadding that his identity gave him the
OL,10,Flegitimacy to say so.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
